      {{ help("This regime's age vs every same-quad period since ~2006 in this classifier. Regimes don't die of old age, but the older one gets relative to history, the more weight each warning deserves. China regimes are short — context, not a forecast.", "当前周期的年龄对比本分类器自约 2006 年以来每一段同象限周期。周期不会因年老而消亡，但相对历史越老，每一面预警越值得加重。中国周期很短 — 仅作背景，而非预测。") }}
