    <p class="note" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t(
      'These are unconditional base rates from a short, regime-unstable history — keep the top path\'s playbook warm, but wait for the growth/inflation dials to actually cross before acting.',
      '这些是来自一段短而不稳定历史的无条件基础概率 — 把最可能路径的剧本备着，但要等增长／通胀刻度盘真正穿越后再行动。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

    </div>
    {% endif %}
