      {{ help("The 16 sector ETFs bucketed by the cycle ladder's entry-timing call (same engine as the US action board). A structure/risk map, not an allocation rule — read alongside the calibration note below.", "16 个板块 ETF 按周期阶梯的入场时机分桶（与美国操作板同一引擎）。这是结构／风险图，而非配置规则 — 请结合下方校准说明阅读。") }}
