      <span class="help">?<span class="tip tip-wide">
        <span class="l-en">
          Forward-graded meter (expected-null; prior sector-level turn in backtest printed NULL — Oracle P8 / DO_NOT_REBUILD §2).
          Display context only — not a directional signal or a return forecast. Tier = display.
          <b>Legs:</b> D = daily MACD bull cross (&le;5 sessions); 3D = house 3-day confluence (MACD+StochRSI);
          W = weekly MACD (confirmed cross &le;3 bars); 2W = biweekly MACD cross.
          <b>States:</b> UPTURN_CONFIRMED (K&ge;3 incl. &ge;1 weekly/2W leg) &middot; UPTURN_WATCH (K&ge;2).
          <b>Monthly phase</b> is anti-trap context only (not a gate).
          CN analog of TS-R3/TS-R4; promotion question earliest 2027.
          Universe: board buy + ripening + THS act-now theme members (&le;400 names).
          Data lands after nightly asia close. Accruing from ship date.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
          前瞻计量（预期空值；回测中板块级别拐点为NULL — Oracle P8 / DO_NOT_REBUILD §2）。
          仅展示参考，非方向信号或收益预测。层级=展示。
          <b>信号腿：</b>D=日线MACD金叉（5日内）；3D=本系统3日共振（MACD+StochRSI）；
          W=周线MACD（确认交叉&le;3根K线）；2W=双周MACD交叉。
          <b>状态：</b>UPTURN_CONFIRMED（K&ge;3含&ge;1周/双周腿）&middot; UPTURN_WATCH（K&ge;2）。
          <b>月线阶段</b>仅作防陷阱参考（非门控）。
          CN版本对应TS-R3/TS-R4；晋升问题最早2027年。
          覆盖范围：买入榜单+成熟区+THS立即行动主题成员（&le;400只）。数据在每晚亚洲收盘后更新。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      {% if _mtf_cn.get('as_of') %}<span class="note" style="text-transform:none"> &middot; {{ _mtf_cn.as_of }}</span>{% endif %}
    </h2>
    {% if _mtf_rows_raw %}
    {# Show UPTURN_CONFIRMED first, then UPTURN_WATCH; cap 12 + show-more #}
    {% set _mtf_all = [] %}
    {% for _sym in _mtf_confirmed %}{% if _mtf_members.get(_sym) %}{% set _ = _mtf_all.append((_sym, _mtf_members[_sym])) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {% for _sym in _mtf_watch %}{% if _mtf_members.get(_sym) %}{% set _ = _mtf_all.append((_sym, _mtf_members[_sym])) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {% set _mtf_visible = _mtf_all[:12] %}
    {% set _mtf_hidden = _mtf_all[12:] %}
    <table class="cn-mtf-tbl">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th class="l">{{ t('Ticker', '代码') }}</th>
          <th><span class="l-en">State</span><span class="l-zh">状态</span></th>
          <th class="r">K</th>
          <th><span class="l-en">Legs (D / 3D / W / 2W)</span><span class="l-zh">信号腿 (D / 3D / W / 2W)</span></th>
          <th><span class="l-en">Monthly phase</span><span class="l-zh">月线阶段</span></th>
          <th class="l"><span class="l-en">Lookup</span><span class="l-zh">详情</span></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="cn-mtf-tbody-vis">
