      {{ help('Where cross-border money is going: the live southbound tape (mainland → Hong Kong) and the Connect leaderboard — the A-shares foreign money traded most and the HK names mainland money net-bought. Northbound daily direction was discontinued by regulators in Aug-2024 (turnover only).', '跨境资金的去向：实时南向盘面（内地 → 香港）与互联互通龙虎榜 — 外资成交最多的 A 股、内地净买入的港股。北向每日方向已于 2024 年 8 月被监管停披（仅余成交额）。') }}
