      {{ help("Net mainland buying of Hong Kong via Stock Connect — the live half of the Connect flows (northbound daily direction was discontinued by regulators in Aug-2024). The z-score is today's net vs its trailing-year distribution; the chart is the 20-day cumulative net. Persistent southbound buying is a mainland risk-appetite tell.", "经港股通的内地净买入香港 — 互联互通中仍实时披露的一侧（北向每日方向于 2024 年 8 月被监管停披）。Z 值为当日净额相对近一年分布；图为 20 日累计净额。持续南下是内地风险偏好的信号。") }}
